.TH PMFORGE 1 "July 2026" "PMForge" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pmforge \- local-first project controls desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pmforge
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B PMForge
is a local-first desktop application for project controls, CPM scheduling,
charting, document export, and encrypted per-project storage.
.SH FILES
On Linux, PMForge stores user data in
.I ~/Documents/PMForge/
unless the
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
environment variable is set.
.SH SEE ALSO
The installed Help Guide and https://github.com/draconianneocoder-cpu/PMForge
